&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 weeks paid vacation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off for your birthday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid volunteer time&lt;/li&gt;
