&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Building regional operating practices that improve team execution, strengthen cross-functional alignment, and scale the impact of Solutions Architects across Central &amp;amp; Eastern Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
